sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Server
    participant E as Executor
    C->>H: SendMessage
    H->>E: execute
    loop until terminal or interrupted
        E->>H: status / artifact events
        H->>H: check and store
    end
    H-->>C: Task (or a direct Message)
